<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/1/measure> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationPositive ;
    cav:judgement """-EU DP database of DG GROW or eLicencings system from DG SANTE, or DG TRADE (to be confirmed by ITCB based on future Business Case)
-Customer verification will leverage the European Business Wallets to authenticate and identify economic operators and public sector bodies across borders, while ensuring interoperability. In addition, the use of the European Business Wallets can be extended to the exchange of credentials (e.g., eLicences and eCertificates) and to the streamlining of reporting obligations."""@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeAlignmentMeasure ;
    dcterms:description "Alignment with existing digital and sectorial policies"@en ;
    dcterms:title "Licensing, registration prior notification platform, customer verification and administrative cooperation platform"@en .

<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/2/measure> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationPositive ;
    cav:judgement """-Art. 4 Free Movement
-Chapter 2, in particular obligations of operators
-Chapter 4, cooperation with and tasks of national authorities"""@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeOrganisationMeasure ;
    dcterms:description "Organisational measures for a smooth cross-border digital public services delivery"@en ;
    dcterms:title "Licensing, registration prior notification platform, customer verification and administrative cooperation platform"@en .

<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/3/barrier> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationNegative ;
    cav:judgement "-Interoperability with customs systems will not be immediately available."@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeSharedBarrier ;
    dcterms:description "Measures taken to ensure a shared understanding of the data"@en ;
    dcterms:title "Licensing, registration prior notification platform, customer verification and administrative cooperation platform"@en .

<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/3/measure> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationPositive ;
    cav:judgement "-A single centralised system willprovide the interface for all drug precursor formalities"@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeSharedMeasure ;
    dcterms:description "Measures taken to ensure a shared understanding of the data"@en ;
    dcterms:title "Licensing, registration prior notification platform, customer verification and administrative cooperation platform"@en .

<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/4/measure> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationPositive ;
    cav:judgement "-Art. 6 communication is to happen in a machine-readable open standard."@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeStandardsMeasure ;
    dcterms:description "Use of commonly agreed open technical specifications and standards"@en ;
    dcterms:title "Licensing, registration prior notification platform, customer verification and administrative cooperation platform"@en .

<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/5/measure> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationPositive ;
    cav:judgement "Regulation (EU) 2022/2399"@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeAlignmentMeasure ;
    m8g:hasRelatedService <http://example.org/analysis/interop/2> ;
    dcterms:description "Alignment with existing digital and sectorial policiesPlease list the applicable digital and sectorial policies identified"@en .

<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/6/measure> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationPositive ;
    cav:judgement """The solution will alter the way actors interact with one another; paper documents will be replaced by electronic documents or messages, happening at a faster pace.
The solution will have a significant impact on the following stakeholders:
Economic operators involved inexternal trade in drug precursors, who apply for licences electronically via the new system.
EU Member Statescompetent authoritieswhoreceive applications for and issue licences
EUcountries’customsofficeswhocontrolcustoms declarationsofdrug precursorsandverifythe relevantlicences electronically.
The European Commission, which is responsible for the development and maintenance of the system, ensuring its functionality and compliance. The EU countries are responsible for connecting their national customs systems to the EU CSW-CERTEX, which in turn ensures connection to the central solution."""@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeOrganisationMeasure ;
    m8g:hasRelatedService <http://example.org/analysis/interop/2> ;
    dcterms:description "Organisational measures for a smooth cross-border digital public services deliveryPlease list the governance measures foreseen"@en .

<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/7/measure> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationPositive ;
    cav:judgement """Data management will prioritise usability, reliability, and security, and support agile updates to meet evolving legal and operational requirements.
The system will be aligned with the EU Customs Data Model (EUCDM) to ensure full interoperability with customs IT systems and compliance with EU customs legislation. Data elements required for import and export procedures will be harmonised and incorporated into future amendments to implementing and delegated regulations related to external trade in drug precursors."""@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeSharedMeasure ;
    m8g:hasRelatedService <http://example.org/analysis/interop/2> ;
    dcterms:description "Measures taken to ensure a shared understanding of the dataPlease list such measures"@en .

<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/8/measure> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationPositive ;
    cav:judgement "Interoperability with customs systems such as EU CSW-CERTEX and TARIC is foreseen."@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeStandardsMeasure ;
    m8g:hasRelatedService <http://example.org/analysis/interop/2> ;
    dcterms:description "Use of commonly agreed open technical specifications and standardsPlease list such measures"@en .

